Z||000000||theogre||11-25-1999||01:06 AM||||I started a new job this week. Unfortunatly they are fairly anal about monitoring the proxy, and I haven't got a way around the fraggin thing yet. What this means is that I won't be checking the forums durring breaks like I used to. So now I have to read thru dozens of messages at a time.<P>If I don't reply as quickly as some are used to, or if I miss your question entirely, I'm not ignoring anyone. I just only have so much time to spend on the forums in the evening. Unfortunatly that means I can't respong to as many threads as I would like.<P>I just wanted to let those who where used to my near real time responcivness what was up.<P>I also wanted to say a very over due thanks to those who've shown their support when things went nuts for me early in the summer and to welcome those who've said thankyou to myself and others who've spent so much time trying to help everyone with these often exasperating cars. It's these seemingly small things that have made these forums work beyond anything myself and I expect Cliff could have ever imagined.<P>I don't remember what the member count was when I came here, but it was pretty low. We are now gathering several, at least, a day. Not to mention all the read-only users.||||reg||1
